    "type": "question",
    "label": "43",
    "prompt": "Expand $(1+0.1)^5$ and hence, write down the decimal representation of $1.1^5$, without the use of a calculator.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(1+0.1)^5=1+0.5+0.1+0.01+0.0005+0.00001$.\n\n$1.1^5=1.61051$.",
      "worked": "Row 5 of Pascal’s triangle is $1,5,10,10,5,1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(1+0.1)^5&=1+5(0.1)+10(0.1)^2+10(0.1)^3+5(0.1)^4+(0.1)^5\\\\(1+0.1)^5&=1+0.5+0.1+0.01+0.0005+0.00001\\\\(1+0.1)^5&=1.61051\\end{align*}$$\n\nHence $1.1^5=1.61051$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
